<title>NETHERLANDS: Gist-Brocades buys Genencor activities.</title>
<headline>Gist-Brocades buys Genencor activities.</headline>
<dateline>DELFT, Netherlands 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch biochemicals and food group Gist-Brocades NV said on Tuesday it had acquired the dairy and diet-enzyme activities of U.S. based Genencor International, Inc for an undisclosed sum.  </p>
<p>It said the various activities, acquired by Genencor from Solvay in 1996, generated annual turnover of some 3.5 million U.S. dollars worldwide.</p>
<p>The deal covered enzymes such as microbial coagulants and neutral lactase, which fitted perfectly in the range produced and marketed by Gist-Brocades, the firm said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;With this purchase Gist-Brocades has further consolidated its activities in the area of food enzymes, and in particular its position as a leading producer and supplier of dairy ingredients,&quot; Gist said.</p>
